{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is detected, then move to object, pick it up, check properties, place in container, explore. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectInContainer    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    />",
